# 换行符策略：仓库内一律 LF
#
# 本机 git 配了 core.autocrlf=true，检出时会把文本文件写成 CRLF，于是每次 add 都刷
# 「LF will be replaced by CRLF」警告，且跨平台/容器里会引入无意义的 diff 噪音。
# 这里显式声明 eol=lf，让 gitattributes 覆盖 autocrlf（无需改用户全局配置）。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须是 CRLF，否则可能执行异常
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制：不做换行转换，也不参与文本 diff
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.webp  binary
*.pdf   binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.docx  binary
*.zip   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.eot   binary
